MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Holiday Spirits felt like a natural choice because its holiday theme connects directly with my repeated Christmas album listening.",
    "That's Christmas To Me also matched that interest, even though I only wanted to choose one album this visit."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Marty Robbins, Ronnie Milsap, Patsy Cline, and country collections did not connect with the holiday listening that made me interested in choosing something today.",
    "Titles such as Pure & Simple, The Definitive Collection, and Take Me Home gave me no clear musical connection to my history, so I had little reason to try them."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The selections seemed to assume that interest in a few albums meant I would also want a broad range of greatest-hits collections.",
    "The country selections seemed to stretch my listening history into an interest in country music that my choices here do not establish."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My Christmas album interactions happened close together in late November, so they suggest a particular holiday listening occasion rather than an interest I necessarily have all year.",
    "My latest interaction was The New Old Fashioned, much later than the Christmas listening; I would need a clearer connection to that album to consider less obviously seasonal choices."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations captured my holiday interest but extended it into collections I had little reason to choose."
}
